@baseUrl = http://localhost:5171

### L01 · menu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/menu

### L01 · bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings


### L02 · ask — Temperature 0 (run 3 times, compare the answers)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Suggest a name for a new Georgian dish.",
  "temperature": 0
}

### L02 · ask — high Temperature (run 3 times, compare with the one above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Suggest a name for a new Georgian dish.",
  "temperature": 1.5
}

### L02 · ask — MaxOutputTokens 50 (finishReason = length)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain how khinkali is made.",
  "maxOutputTokens": 50
}

### L02 · chat — a normal question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Until what time are you open?"
}

### L02 · chat — another topic (should politely decline)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Write me a poem about the sea."
}

### L02 · chat — a price question (should not invent a price)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How much is khinkali?"
}

### L02 · sentiment — Positive
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/ai/sentiment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Everything was perfect, we'll definitely come back!"
}

### L02 · sentiment — Negative
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/ai/sentiment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "The waiter was rude and the mtsvadi was burnt."
}

### L02 · sentiment — Mixed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/ai/sentiment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Great wine, but the music was too loud."
}
